'' 'sys' IS NOT SHADOWABLE: -i names a directory holding a package called sys with a module
'' sys/fake. sys is looked for in the toolchain's pkg/ alone, which has no fake, so the import
'' is TKO0140 -- the -i root is never asked.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i tests/modules/src/sysres/roots tests/modules/src/sysres/main.tiko -o build/.sysshadow.exe
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: error TKO0140: cannot find module 'sys/fake'
